ord-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;npc&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> introduced </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coercion <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> validDetails</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> introduced </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coercion</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>I can use hjust = &#39;center&#39; in other places, like geom_text. </div><div><br></div><div>Is this a bug? </div><br><br><br><br><br><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;border-width:initial;border-style:none;outline:none;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:1020.5px;font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;!important;font-size:16.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><tbody></tbody></table><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
