   "subject": "Re: Centre the Plot Title",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for pointing this out!<div><br></div><div>The ggplot2 &quot;Aesthetic specifications&quot; (ggplot2-specs vignette) says that the grid drawing functions accept this parameter. So I guess element_text() is not considered a grid drawing function?</div><div><br></div><div>It would be more consistent and result in more readable code if element_text also accepted character specifications. Maybe this should be a feature request?</div><div><br></div><div>James</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
